{"날짜": "2026-10-02", "시험지명": "용인삼계고_고1_2026_2_중간", "루프ID": "20261002-CL-G1S-5dd865a5", "문항": {"14": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">좌표평면 위의 세 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>에 대하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mover><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" accent=\"true\">&#x000AF;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mover><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" accent=\"true\">&#x000AF;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mover><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" accent=\"true\">&#x000AF;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></math>이다. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02220;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>의 이등분선과 선분 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>와의 교점의 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>좌표는? (단, 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mrow></math>는 원점이고, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>c</mi></mrow></math>는 모두 양수이다.)</p><p></p></div>", "유형": "기출 14번 · 각의 이등분선의 성질"}}}